WEBVTT

00:03.914 --> 00:08.544
Yes, Judith, I did deduct $30
from your child-support check this month.

00:09.453 --> 00:12.320
Because I paid for Jake's haircut.

00:12.489 --> 00:16.255
Yes, it is usually $9, but he wanted
to go someplace without hobbyhorses.

00:18.595 --> 00:23.225
I know he's never gonna win
any beauty contests, but he is our son.

00:24.401 --> 00:27.234
Look, I've got a patient. I gotta go.

00:27.638 --> 00:29.765
Sorry you had to hear that.

00:30.073 --> 00:32.633
That's, uh... That's my ex-wife.

00:33.911 --> 00:35.208
Beyotch.

00:39.883 --> 00:43.046
- Hello, Mrs. Honeycutt. I'm Dr. Harper.
- Doctor.

00:43.220 --> 00:46.053
Okay, so you are having spasms
in your lower back?

00:46.223 --> 00:49.590
Yeah, it's awful.
Some days I can't even get out of bed.

00:49.760 --> 00:52.422
- Oh, I know how that is.
- You have back problems too?

00:53.397 --> 00:54.921
No.

00:55.098 --> 00:58.431
Why don't you lie face down?
We'll see if we can locate the problem.

00:58.602 --> 01:00.593
I've tried everything.

01:00.771 --> 01:05.299
Acupuncture, yoga, shiatsu.
Nothing seems to work.

01:05.475 --> 01:09.377
Not surprised. Those Eastern practices
are mostly hooey.

01:09.546 --> 01:13.915
Modern chiropractic, on the other hand,
is built on over 50 years of solid science.

01:14.084 --> 01:18.885
Okay, let's take a look
at what we've got here.

01:19.056 --> 01:22.389
- Okay. Now, is this too much pressure?
- No.

01:22.559 --> 01:25.027
- Okay, how about this?
- No.

01:25.195 --> 01:27.254
Okay. Now, is this
where the spasms occur?

01:27.431 --> 01:29.991
- A little lower.
- Okay.

01:30.167 --> 01:32.658
- Here?
- Ahh, lower.

01:32.836 --> 01:34.428
- Here?
- Aww! Oh.

01:34.605 --> 01:37.904
- Am I hurting you?
- No. God, no.

01:40.043 --> 01:43.137
Nobody's touched me like this
since my husband died.

01:44.181 --> 01:47.014
Oh, um, I'm so sorry. Um...
How long has it been since...

01:48.418 --> 01:49.510
That long, huh?

01:52.823 --> 01:55.223
Oh, my. It's, uh, pretty sensitive here.

01:55.425 --> 01:56.449
Harder.

01:57.427 --> 01:59.622
Oh. Okay, no problem. Um.

01:59.796 --> 02:02.822
So just out of curiosity,
how did you find me?

02:03.000 --> 02:05.161
A referral? My website?

02:05.335 --> 02:08.361
Or the flyers at the Mongolian barbecue
across the street?

02:08.538 --> 02:10.005
Shut up and rub.

02:10.707 --> 02:13.073
Uh, I'm not technically rubbing.

02:13.243 --> 02:15.837
- Whoa, Nelly.
Oh! Don't stop.

02:16.013 --> 02:18.311
I'm not stopping.
Oh, spank me.

02:19.716 --> 02:22.708
I'm... I'm sorry?
Spank my lonely ass!

02:22.886 --> 02:25.047
What?
Do it, bitch!

02:26.423 --> 02:29.153
Yes, Dr. Harper! Yes!

02:29.993 --> 02:33.156
Oh, God, yes!

02:50.580 --> 02:52.707
Okay, let's take a look at the schedule.

02:52.883 --> 02:56.216
See what the rest
of the afternoon looks like.

02:56.386 --> 02:58.286
Oh, that's not too bad.

03:00.490 --> 03:03.186
So how are you liking
your first day at work here?

03:05.262 --> 03:06.729
Thank you, Dr. Harper.

03:06.897 --> 03:08.797
Uh, you are most welcome.

03:08.999 --> 03:12.628
And remember, alternating an ice pack
with a, uh, a heating pad...

03:12.803 --> 03:14.464
...is very helpful for spasming.

03:14.638 --> 03:17.732
- I'd like to make another appointment.
- Oh, sure, sure.

03:17.908 --> 03:20.069
What were you thinking?
Maybe next week or?

03:20.243 --> 03:21.870
- Tonight.
- To... Uh...

03:22.045 --> 03:24.946
Tonight? Oh, gloriosky.

03:25.649 --> 03:30.609
- Well, we, uh, we close up at 5...
- So I can expect you at my place at 9.

03:30.787 --> 03:33.915
Oh, gee, uh, I don't do house calls.

03:35.025 --> 03:37.289
Per se.

03:37.461 --> 03:39.554
See you at 9.

03:46.336 --> 03:49.464
Uh... Some patients pay in cash.

03:51.341 --> 03:54.936
Their insurance, uh,
won't cover chiropractic.

03:55.112 --> 03:58.275
Part of our ongoing healthcare crisis.

03:58.448 --> 03:59.813
Tragic, really.

04:02.719 --> 04:05.688
Uh, by the way,
you are doing one heck of a job.

04:07.958 --> 04:10.791
In fact, here's a little something for you.

04:10.961 --> 04:13.122
Just because your smile
lights up the place.

04:14.831 --> 04:17.561
You know what? Let's sweeten the pot.

04:18.001 --> 04:19.628
Um, can you give me 10 back?

04:21.438 --> 04:22.803
Not a problem.

04:22.973 --> 04:24.702
Can't put a price on a smile.

04:56.673 --> 04:58.402
- I like the new look.
- Thanks.

04:58.575 --> 05:00.440
It's fashion forward.

05:00.610 --> 05:01.668
What does that mean?

05:01.845 --> 05:04.405
I don't know.
It's what the guy who cut my hair said.

05:04.581 --> 05:07.243
He also said it was fun and fabulous.

05:07.417 --> 05:08.475
Really?

05:08.652 --> 05:11.177
Yeah. And he invited Dad to a party.

05:13.657 --> 05:15.352
I didn't go.

05:15.525 --> 05:16.958
It's just nice to be asked.

05:18.061 --> 05:21.553
So why'd you decide to abandon
your classic cereal-bowl coif?

05:22.165 --> 05:23.291
What's a coif?

05:23.466 --> 05:26.924
- You can't glean it from the context?
- What's "glean"?

05:27.437 --> 05:29.166
Why'd you change your freaking hair?

05:29.339 --> 05:31.102
My new girlfriend wanted me to.

05:31.274 --> 05:34.266
If your girlfriend wanted you
to jump off a bridge, would you?

05:34.444 --> 05:37.379
If she put her tongue in my mouth
when she asked me, yeah.

05:38.982 --> 05:42.076
I can't blame you. I bought a woman
a car for the same reason.

05:42.586 --> 05:44.816
She put her tongue in your mouth?

05:45.355 --> 05:48.017
Sure, let's say "mouth."

05:48.592 --> 05:50.389
Can we get the check, please?

05:50.594 --> 05:53.222
Hey, why don't you let me get this one?

05:53.396 --> 05:55.626
Really? Not gonna go
for the world record?

05:55.799 --> 05:57.664
- What?
- One thousand six hundred...

05:57.834 --> 06:01.793
...and forty-seven meals in a row where
you haven't taken out your Velcro wallet.

06:02.339 --> 06:04.204
- You were counting?
- Am I close?

06:05.375 --> 06:08.173
Nevertheless, I'm paying.

06:09.646 --> 06:12.274
Smell that? The air coming out
of your father's wallet...

06:12.449 --> 06:14.815
...has been in there
since before you were born.

06:14.985 --> 06:16.179
Very funny.

06:16.987 --> 06:19.012
- Thank you.
- Wait, wait.

06:19.189 --> 06:21.123
Nobody is gonna believe this.

06:21.858 --> 06:23.985
For God's sake.

06:29.866 --> 06:31.993
Hey, isn't that Chelsea's friend Gail?

06:33.570 --> 06:34.662
Oh, yeah.

06:35.405 --> 06:37.737
- Wonder if I should say hello.
- I wouldn't mind.

06:37.908 --> 06:40.433
Finish paying the check, you weasel.

06:42.145 --> 06:44.943
As long as you got your wallet out,
I could use new sneaks.

06:45.315 --> 06:46.543
Hm. Oh.

06:46.716 --> 06:47.774
Sure.

06:49.052 --> 06:50.280
Are you dying?

06:53.356 --> 06:56.018
- Charlie.
- Oh, hi, Gail.

06:57.727 --> 06:59.661
- Great to see you.
- How have you been?

06:59.829 --> 07:01.160
Pretty good. You?

07:01.898 --> 07:03.422
Well, you know.

07:03.600 --> 07:05.864
Yeah, I'm sorry to hear
about you and Chelsea.

07:06.036 --> 07:07.230
Way it goes.

07:07.404 --> 07:10.601
Win some, lose some, start having
liquor delivered to your house...

07:10.774 --> 07:12.799
...so you don't have to put on pants.

07:12.976 --> 07:15.171
If it's any consolation,
I know how you feel.

07:15.345 --> 07:18.075
I'm still not over my breakup.

07:18.415 --> 07:21.543
But I'm not much of a drinker, so cheers.

07:22.886 --> 07:25.184
Have you, um... Have you seen Chelsea?

07:25.355 --> 07:27.880
Yeah. Actually, I had dinner
with her and...

07:28.058 --> 07:29.923
We had dinner just the other night.

07:30.093 --> 07:33.290
- Her and Brad?
- Yeah, come to think of it, he was there.

07:33.463 --> 07:36.227
- Sounds like they're an item now, eh?
- I guess.

07:36.399 --> 07:37.889
You guess?

07:38.068 --> 07:40.764
What do you want?
They're in Mexico for the weekend.

07:41.304 --> 07:44.398
Mexico. Nice. I went there with her once.

07:44.574 --> 07:46.838
- I'm sorry.
- No, no, no. It's fine.

07:47.010 --> 07:50.571
We had a great time. In fact,
when we got back, I bought her a car.

07:51.481 --> 07:53.312
Yeah, she told me.

07:53.683 --> 07:55.150
Eww.

07:55.752 --> 07:58.084
Listen, I gotta go.

07:58.722 --> 08:00.155
But if you ever wanna talk...

08:00.724 --> 08:01.816
Oh, thank you.

08:01.992 --> 08:03.789
- Bye.
- Bye-bye.

08:04.294 --> 08:08.788
For the last time, I am not dying
and I'm not sick. Everything's fine.

08:08.965 --> 08:10.262
Okay, I got it.

08:10.433 --> 08:12.924
But you can understand
my skepticism, right?

08:20.110 --> 08:22.340
I really don't see
why I shouldn't ask her out.

08:22.512 --> 08:25.003
Seriously? The woman
is Chelsea's best friend.

08:25.648 --> 08:27.639
So? She's single. I'm single.

08:27.817 --> 08:31.776
She's lonely. I'm lonely.
She's gorgeous. I'm well above average.

08:32.756 --> 08:36.453
- I'm just saying it's a bad idea.
- I never said it wasn't a bad idea.

08:36.626 --> 08:38.821
I said, I don't know why I shouldn't do it.

08:40.964 --> 08:43.626
- What is that?
- It's a portable massage table.

08:43.800 --> 08:45.995
So you're giving rub-and-tugs
on the pier now?

08:46.770 --> 08:50.035
No. No, I am a licensed professional.

08:50.206 --> 08:54.302
And I will not stand here
and be accused of unethical behavior.

08:54.477 --> 08:58.208
I mean, just because you have
no moral compass doesn't mean I don't.

08:58.381 --> 09:00.406
And while, yes, that's a triple negative...

09:00.583 --> 09:04.679
...it, nevertheless, defines me as the man
for whom I am aiming to be.

09:05.822 --> 09:07.790
What the hell are you talking about?

09:07.957 --> 09:12.587
I am just trying to augment my income
by seeing clients in their homes...

09:12.796 --> 09:15.856
...thus, alleviating them
of the added stress of commuting.

09:16.032 --> 09:18.057
Not to mention speed bumps
and pot holes...

09:18.234 --> 09:20.498
...of which, as you know,
can jostle the spine.

09:24.107 --> 09:29.238
Wow, guy picks up one $30 check
and he has a brain aneurysm.

09:39.322 --> 09:40.949
Yeah?

09:41.591 --> 09:43.115
Chelsea?

09:43.326 --> 09:45.590
Hey, how are you?

09:45.762 --> 09:46.786
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

09:46.963 --> 09:50.592
Slow down. Slow down.
Why are you crying?

09:51.734 --> 09:55.329
Wait a minute, you're in Mexico?

09:55.705 --> 09:58.868
Why on Earth are you in Mexico?

09:59.042 --> 10:02.239
Oh, sure, Brad.

10:03.746 --> 10:07.978
Oh, sweetie,
I'm sorry it's not working out.

10:08.218 --> 10:13.053
Well, I love you and I miss you too.
When are you gonna be back?

10:13.256 --> 10:17.386
Okay. Okay, I'll see you tomorrow.
I can't wait.

10:17.560 --> 10:19.858
All right. Bye-bye, sweetie.

10:24.434 --> 10:26.459
I hope that smile is for me.

10:30.974 --> 10:32.202
Uh...

10:32.375 --> 10:34.809
Who else would it be for?

10:42.485 --> 10:44.350
You ready for round two?

10:44.521 --> 10:46.216
Well, um...

10:46.823 --> 10:48.484
...yes and no.

10:50.126 --> 10:52.822
- Is something wrong?
- Yeah.

10:52.996 --> 10:55.931
While you were in the bathroom,
uh, Chelsea called.

10:57.200 --> 10:58.497
Really?

10:58.668 --> 11:02.263
Apparently, things didn't go well
in Mexico and she's coming home.

11:02.438 --> 11:03.700
Oh, that's a shame.

11:03.873 --> 11:05.534
Yeah.

11:06.009 --> 11:07.442
Anyway, she wants to see me.

11:07.644 --> 11:10.272
Said she loves me and misses me.

11:11.281 --> 11:13.841
So one call and you're just
gonna go running back?

11:14.417 --> 11:16.749
Uh, yeah.

11:19.556 --> 11:21.285
Well, heh.

11:21.624 --> 11:23.353
This is awkward.

11:23.893 --> 11:25.793
Come on, you know how I feel about her.

11:26.930 --> 11:28.488
I do.

11:28.765 --> 11:30.289
So we should probably keep...

11:30.466 --> 11:33.026
...what happened tonight
just between us, right?

11:33.937 --> 11:36.030
Mum's the word. Zip the lip.

11:36.206 --> 11:38.731
Lx-nay on the oggy-day yle-stay?

11:40.376 --> 11:41.673
Of course.

11:44.547 --> 11:45.673
You know...

11:47.250 --> 11:50.811
...we could just pretend that you didn't
get the phone call for, like...

11:50.987 --> 11:52.318
...another hour.

11:53.122 --> 11:54.282
We could, couldn't we?

11:56.092 --> 11:59.721
But wouldn't that be wrong?

12:00.563 --> 12:02.588
I won't tell if you don't.

12:03.833 --> 12:08.065
Ugh, I'm sorry, Gail.
I can't justify it to myself.

12:08.238 --> 12:09.899
Okay.

12:10.073 --> 12:12.598
Well, can I at least kiss you good night?

12:12.775 --> 12:13.901
Sure.

12:23.987 --> 12:26.751
On the other hand,
there's no arguing with a boner.

12:32.028 --> 12:36.829
Let's see,
when Gail came over, it was 11:00 here...

12:37.000 --> 12:38.797
...and midnight in Cabo.

12:39.736 --> 12:43.797
When Chelsea called,
it was midnight here and 1:00 in Cabo.

12:43.973 --> 12:50.139
So when I did Gail at 12:10,
Chelsea technically hadn't called yet.

12:51.648 --> 12:54.481
Not my best work, but I can live with it.

12:57.353 --> 12:59.947
- Hey.
- Hey.

13:06.029 --> 13:07.792
Tough night, Bunky?

13:07.964 --> 13:10.057
I'm a whore, Charlie.

13:10.700 --> 13:12.327
Oh, don't be so hard on yourself.

13:12.502 --> 13:14.629
Jake needed a haircut,
and you had no money.

13:14.804 --> 13:16.169
What? No. No.

13:16.906 --> 13:19.568
I took money to give a woman pleasure.

13:20.643 --> 13:22.702
Wait a minute. You...

13:22.879 --> 13:24.403
...gave a woman pleasure?

13:25.081 --> 13:28.175
Oh, you have no idea
what powerful orgasms these hands...

13:28.351 --> 13:29.841
...are capable of delivering.

13:30.019 --> 13:32.920
No, I've always known that.
I just find it hard to believe...

13:33.089 --> 13:35.284
...they could give them to other people.

13:37.193 --> 13:41.220
Yeah, well, maybe this'll convince you.

13:43.566 --> 13:45.557
- A woman gave you this?
- Uh-huh.

13:45.735 --> 13:49.671
Right before she told me she was done
with me and I could show myself out.

13:49.839 --> 13:52.808
Sounds like a dream date to me.
So, what's the problem?

13:53.309 --> 13:54.606
How do I live with myself?

13:54.811 --> 13:56.802
How did you live with yourself before?

13:56.979 --> 13:58.947
By thinking I was better than you.

13:59.115 --> 14:02.084
Now, after all these years,
I've descended to your level.

14:02.251 --> 14:03.377
Oh, no, no, no.

14:03.553 --> 14:05.578
I may have done
some questionable things...

14:05.755 --> 14:08.815
...but I have never taken money for it.

14:08.991 --> 14:11.585
That's not to say it wasn't offered.

14:11.761 --> 14:13.626
And deservedly so.

14:13.830 --> 14:15.127
Fine, I'm worse than you.

14:15.331 --> 14:17.595
That's all I'm saying.

14:17.767 --> 14:21.225
Well, I am going to take a shower
and try to wash the cheapness off me.

14:21.404 --> 14:23.838
Better take some steel wool
and a cheese grater.

14:25.708 --> 14:27.141
Hey, Alan.

14:27.577 --> 14:29.511
Oh. Gail.

14:30.213 --> 14:31.976
Hi.

14:32.215 --> 14:34.376
&lt;i>Don't judge me, Pretty Woman.&lt;/i>

14:37.420 --> 14:40.548
- Uh, Charlie, I better get going.
- Right. Right.

14:40.723 --> 14:42.350
So, uh, you and I are okay?

14:42.525 --> 14:44.425
Yeah. I'm just sorry it has to end.

14:44.594 --> 14:46.994
- Yeah, me too.
- Chelsea's a lucky girl.

14:47.163 --> 14:50.257
You think so? You should tell her.
I mean, don't tell her.

14:51.367 --> 14:54.495
- Bye.
- Bye-bye.

14:57.173 --> 14:58.435
Thank you, Charlie.

14:59.242 --> 15:00.971
- For what?
- Proving once again...

15:01.144 --> 15:03.442
...that I am better than you.

15:04.480 --> 15:08.678
Hey. Hey. I'm just a rascal.
You are a male prostitute.

15:12.522 --> 15:14.581
That is a terribly hurtful thing to say.

15:23.900 --> 15:27.392
So there we are in this beautiful
hotel room overlooking the ocean...

15:27.570 --> 15:31.404
...and he's on the phone with his mother,
trying to help her download music.

15:31.574 --> 15:33.838
- You're kidding.
- And I just sat there thinking:

15:34.010 --> 15:38.174
"Charlie would never do this. Charlie
hates his mother with a blind passion."

15:38.981 --> 15:41.472
Remember when you used to think
that was a bad thing?

15:42.118 --> 15:44.052
And when Brad's not on the phone...

15:44.220 --> 15:46.848
...he's telling me how much
I remind him of his mother.

15:47.023 --> 15:48.820
I hope not while you were in bed.

15:48.991 --> 15:51.516
Because that would reflect badly
on everybody.

15:51.694 --> 15:52.854
You don't wanna know.

15:53.429 --> 15:56.421
There's nothing to know.
You went to Mexico with another man...

15:56.599 --> 16:00.126
...he talked about his mother in bed,
and you didn't have sex with him.

16:00.303 --> 16:02.703
- Charlie...
- That's what happened. End of story.

16:05.074 --> 16:07.133
I should never have let you go.

16:07.310 --> 16:09.835
Well, sometimes you can't appreciate
what you've got...

16:10.012 --> 16:13.539
...until you go to Mexico
and don't have sex with a mama's boy.

16:15.051 --> 16:17.747
I'm sorry about Brad.
I know that hurt you.

16:18.454 --> 16:21.890
Water under the bridge.
What you did, what I did, doesn't matter.

16:22.058 --> 16:24.891
- What did you do?
- Doesn't matter.

16:25.528 --> 16:27.052
Charlie, no secrets.

16:27.230 --> 16:28.891
Please, can't I just have one?

16:29.065 --> 16:32.000
Whatever it is, it doesn't matter.
We were separated.

16:33.903 --> 16:36.337
All right, here goes.

16:36.506 --> 16:39.100
I was having pizza
with Alan and Jake the other day.

16:39.275 --> 16:42.676
By the way, Jake got a new haircut.
It's just fabulous.

16:43.379 --> 16:47.213
Okay, well, you'll never guess
who was there getting takeout.

16:48.584 --> 16:50.108
Your old buddy Gail.

16:51.254 --> 16:52.516
Oh, my God, you didn't.

16:53.022 --> 16:55.286
I didn't say I did, but good guess.

16:57.593 --> 16:59.720
- I don't believe you.
- What?

16:59.896 --> 17:01.887
We were separated. You were in Mexico.

17:02.064 --> 17:03.361
But she's my best friend.

17:03.533 --> 17:06.366
Yeah, well, I'd have to say
the jury's still out on that.

17:07.236 --> 17:08.362
You are such a pig.

17:08.971 --> 17:11.132
A... A... A pig who hates his mother.

17:11.307 --> 17:12.501
Go to hell.

17:13.242 --> 17:18.043
Oh, come on. It was 1:00 in Cabo.

17:20.583 --> 17:22.778
Lower.

17:22.952 --> 17:24.783
How about here?

17:24.954 --> 17:31.120
Oh, yeah. That's how Mommy likes it.

17:32.128 --> 17:34.528
Okay, you know what? I'm sorry.
I can't do this.

17:35.064 --> 17:37.760
- What's wrong?
- I am a professional.

17:37.934 --> 17:41.392
I studied chiropractic
for three years in Guadalajara.

17:41.571 --> 17:43.937
That was with almost
no Spanish language skills...

17:44.106 --> 17:46.631
...and a family of parasites
living in my colon.

17:46.809 --> 17:51.803
And I did not go through all of that
to become some sort of G-spot Johnny.

17:51.981 --> 17:54.074
Is that what you think you are?

17:54.250 --> 17:57.185
Well, you're giving me money
and I'm giving you...

17:57.353 --> 18:00.186
...what I'm giving you.
It just makes me feel cheap.

18:00.356 --> 18:02.449
It's too much
like a business transaction.

18:02.625 --> 18:03.649
Exactly.

18:03.826 --> 18:05.350
How about we forget the money...

18:05.561 --> 18:08.997
...and I'll show you something
I learned in Guadalajara?

18:09.966 --> 18:11.593
What?

18:27.850 --> 18:30.318
Oh, hey. Hi.

18:30.486 --> 18:32.886
I'm sorry. I overreacted.

18:33.856 --> 18:35.221
Yeah, you kind of did.

18:35.725 --> 18:40.162
You're both single, you're both adults,
and you and I were separated.

18:40.329 --> 18:43.594
Plus, you were honest with me,
so I'm willing to put it behind us.

18:43.766 --> 18:47.031
Oh, thank you. Thank you.
I love you so much.

18:47.203 --> 18:48.465
I love you too.

18:50.473 --> 18:54.204
Why don't I take you out for a nice lunch
and we'll catch up?

18:54.377 --> 18:55.537
You wanna go out?

18:56.145 --> 18:58.978
I'm a little hungry.
Aren't you a little hungry?

18:59.248 --> 19:00.681
Gail's upstairs, isn't she?

19:02.351 --> 19:06.219
Once again, we were separated
and I was vulnerable.

19:06.756 --> 19:11.250
Just so we're on the same page, are we
together or am I allowed to go upstairs?

19:13.362 --> 19:14.829
Damn.

19:22.505 --> 19:25.440
Oh, how much madder could she get?

19:29.845 --> 19:33.110
Okay, well, I think we're making good
progress with the back spasms.

19:33.282 --> 19:36.274
- Thank you. I'll see you on Wednesday.
- Looking forward to it.

19:36.452 --> 19:37.783
- And Mrs. Honeycutt?
- Yes?

19:38.354 --> 19:41.380
If it's okay, I'd like to go back
to our original arrangement.

19:41.557 --> 19:43.457
But you said it made you feel cheap.

19:43.626 --> 19:46.390
What can I say? Turns out I am cheap.

19:46.996 --> 19:48.258
Your call. Bye-bye.

19:49.131 --> 19:51.099
Bye.

19:58.274 --> 20:01.437
Ha, have I told you lately
that you are doing a great job?

20:01.610 --> 20:04.636
Ha-ha-ha.
Because you are doing a great job.

20:06.649 --> 20:10.244
In fact, I am gonna make you
employee of the month.

20:11.954 --> 20:14.149
I want an adjustment.

20:16.759 --> 20:18.989
Uh, I'm sorry.
Are you having back problems?

20:19.161 --> 20:22.824
No, I want an adjustment
like you give her.

20:26.202 --> 20:28.796
Oh, gee, I don't think
that would be appropriate.

20:28.971 --> 20:32.907
All right,
then I want a raise and dental insurance.

20:33.809 --> 20:35.140
Hop on the table.
